The Liquid Glass theme in src/renderer/src/liquid/ (glass-gl.ts, toggle.ts,
tabbar.ts, button.ts) and src/renderer/src/assets/liquid-glass.css is ported
from m-ui (https://github.com/RomanovCaesar/m-ui, web/liquid-*.js and
web/liquid-*.css), which adapted it from this project: the spring solvers,
velocity tracker, lens refraction with chromatic dispersion, toggle combined
backdrop, ambient and default rim highlights, the bottom-tab indicator,
InteractiveHighlight press dynamics, the LiquidButton and Dialog materials,
and the component geometry, colours and spring constants. The code was
translated from TypeScript/GLSL into framework-free JavaScript/GLSL and
modified to render inside individual DOM controls.

That project is itself a web port of AndroidLiquidGlass by Kyant
(https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass).
